# NessoTalk snippets: name = expansion. Say "snippet <name>" (or "insert
# snippet <name>") anywhere in a dictation and it expands in place.
# \n in the expansion becomes a newline. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Examples (uncomment and edit):
# email = bschwartz1725@gmail.com
# calendly = Grab a time here: https://calendly.com/bradyschwartz
# intro = I'm Brady, 18, heading to USC for AI. I build custom software and AI systems for businesses.
